    ("What is an aftershock?", "a smaller earthquake that follows the main earthquake", ["the first big earthquake", "a sea wave", "a sound from the volcano"], "Aftershocks can continue for days or weeks."),
    ("What is a tsunami?", "a series of huge sea waves caused by an undersea earthquake or volcanic eruption", ["a strong typhoon", "a big river flood from rain", "a high tide caused by the Moon"], "Move to high ground if the sea suddenly pulls back."),
    ("What is a natural sign of a coming tsunami?", "the sea suddenly pulls back far from the shore", ["the sky turns green", "it becomes very cold", "the wind stops for a minute"], "Run to high ground right away."),
    ("Which instrument records earthquake waves?", "a seismograph", ["a barometer", "an anemometer", "a telescope"], "The record is called a seismogram."),
